m pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3.0<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">October 28, 1997<br/>Alpha 3.0</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20230222234659&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lit_Torch_1d6acb.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a lit torch.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 5.00 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>As the torch is used, the light gets weaker and the torch shorter. This first stage lasts for 10 minutes, after which it becomes a Lit Torch (Medium).\n</p><p>It was once a useful item. People always carried one of these in their belt to save mana in hunts from casting light spells. However, since the ambient light feature was implemented, torches were left behind, and nowadays they are almost completely useless.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>With the spring patch 2012 the sprite of Torch changed from <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Torch (Old)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Torch_Old_d23773.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> to <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Torch\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Torch_c65789.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Burnt Down Torch</li><li>Extra Slot</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/grimvale-quest\">Grimvale Quest</a></li><li>Light Sources</li><li>Lit Torch (Medium)</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Torch\">Torch</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["grimvale-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"grimvale-quest","quest":"Grimvale Quest","step":"12-4","n":99,"title":"Sacrifício: Dewberry Palm Leaf","kind":"needed","coords":[]},{"slug":"grimvale-quest","quest":"Grimvale Quest","step":"12-5","n":100,"title":"Sacrifício: queimar a folha","kind":"needed","coords":[]}]}}